# Direct dependencies of the relay. relay/requirements.txt is generated from
# this file with every transitive package pinned and hash-checked, so each
# add-on build installs exactly what CI tested. Compiled for 3.12, the oldest
# Python CI tests, so markers keep it valid for every version up to the
# image's 3.15. Regenerate after editing:
